{"id": "86273", "name": "Set_Intersection_2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Let</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}}, B={{CT:1}}\\mbox{ and } C={{CT:2}}. \\]</p><p>Work out, using only the definition of union, intersection and complement,</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[(A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\((A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)\\)= [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Note: \\({{CT:3}}\\) is entered as <code>delta</code>, \\({{CT:4}}\\) is entered as <code>beta</code> and \\({{CT:5}}\\) is entered as <code>gamma</code>. Sets are entered using <code>{}</code>, e.g. <code>{1,2,3}</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>The intersection of \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) is the set of all elements contained in both \\(A\\) and \\(B\\), hence</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A \\cap B = {{CT:6}}.\\]</p><p>Similarly, the intersection of \\(A\\) and \\(C\\) is the set of all elements contained in both \\(A\\) and \\(C\\), hence</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A \\cap C = {{CT:7}}.\\]</p><p>The union of two sets is the set containing all elements that are in either or both of the two sets, hence,</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C) = {{CT:6}}\\cup{{CT:7}}={{CT:8}}.\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "intersection", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "correctanswer", "partsetA", "partsetB", "partsetC", "q", "q1", "q2", "setA", "setB", "setC"], "nvariants": 50}